  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "gift-pretrain-full-4096",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tgift-pretrain-full-4096\n\t\n\nFull counterpart to jeremycochoy/gift-pretrain-small-4096:\nevery series of every arrow file in\nSalesforce/GiftEvalPretrain,\ncropped into non-overlapping 4096-point windows and globally\nshuffled. The small companion sub-samples 10 series per sub-dataset;\nthis one keeps everything.\n\n6,376 source arrow files across 152 sub-datasets fully consumed\n42,571,692 windows of length 4096 (float32)\n4,274 parquet shards, ~619 GB total (zstd)\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tLayout\n\t\n\n.\n\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/jeremycochoy/gift-pretrain-full-4096.",
  "alternateName": [
    "jeremycochoy/gift-pretrain-full-4096"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Cochoy",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/jeremycochoy"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "time-series-forecasting",
    "apache-2.0",
    "10M<n<100M",
    "Time-series",
    "\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Region: US",
    "timeseries",
    "forecasting",
    "benchmark",
    "gifteval",
    "pretraining"
  ],
